<DocsLayout title="Search">
  <p>A dedicated find interface and workspace-wide search are not available yet. The current navigation tools make it quick to move between files and headings.</p>

  <h2>Planned search</h2>
  <p>In-document find and workspace-wide search are prioritised from alpha feedback.</p>

  <h2>File navigation</h2>
  <p>Use <kbd>⌘P</kbd> to open the command palette and switch between open files by name.</p>

  <h2>Outline</h2>
  <p>The outline panel lists document headings parsed from the syntax tree. Click a heading to jump to that position.</p>
</DocsLayout>
